    "https://biomedit.ch/rdf/sphn-metacat/sphn/hasInclusionCriteria": [
      {
        "@value": "For included patients, only administrative cases (stays) with the following criteria should be included. If a given administrative case follows the criteria, all its associated data for the list of reused SPHN concepts should be included: Age >= 18 years at admission, Inpatient setting, Acute care (Hospital stay 'Class A'), Period: from the beginning of hospital stay after 01/01/2014 until the current day of cohort creation, Length of stay â¥24h consecutively in at least one units/subunits of interest. For included patients, patient-associated data from the following concepts should be included regardless of their association with an administrative case (i.e. including before 2014 and regardless of the unit): Allergy, Administrative Sex, Birth Date, Death, Billed Diagnosis."
      }
    ],
